    -sheaves and Gieseker-Harder-Narasimhan filtrations" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">4.5 </span><math class="ltx_Math" alttext="\Theta" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi mathvariant="normal">Θ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\Theta</annotation></semantics></math>-stratification, semistability and leading term filtrations</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
