<li id="bib.bibx3" class="ltx_bibitem"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_bibitem">[AHLH23]</span>
<span class="ltx_bibblock"><span id="bib.bibx3.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">
Jarod Alper, Daniel Halpern-Leistner, and Jochen Heinloth.
</span>
